{"content":"{\n  \"status\": \"ready_for_review\",\n  \"objectives\": {\n    \"primary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"在经 HRCT 或肺活检确诊 IPF 的成人受试者中，评估 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，至第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL）的疗效；采用固定序列检验：先 AD-101 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，达到统计学显著后再检验 AD-101 100 mg qd 对比安慰剂。\",\n        \"basis\": \"user\",\n        \"reason\": \"用户样本量假设明确以第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值组间差异为主要疗效依据，并确认固定序列检验；源资料将同一指标列为主要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Primary endpoint: absolute change from baseline in forced vital capacity (FVC) in mL at Week 52\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂的安全性，包括 AE/SAE、实验室检查、生命体征、ECG、耐受性、减量和停药情况。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"用户确认设有安全性随访、IDMC 安全性审阅，且研究目的包含安全性评价；具体安全性终点集合需按标准实践在 SAP 中细化。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估第 52 周 FVC 占预计值百分比变化、6 分钟步行距离变化、无进展生存期（疾病进展或死亡）及圣乔治呼吸问卷（SGRQ）总分变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源资料将这些指标列为关键次要终点；仅作为候选建议，待下游人审确认。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"endpoint\": {\n    \"primary_endpoint\": {\n      \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL）。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户样本量假设明确以第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值组间差异为主要疗效依据；源资料将同一指标列为主要终点。备选为第 52 周 FVC 较基线相对变化或百分预计值变化，但本样本量假设与源资料主要终点均支持绝对变化值。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"Primary endpoint: absolute change from baseline in forced vital capacity (FVC) in mL at Week 52\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"key_secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 占预计值百分比变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源资料将百分预计值 FVC 变化列为关键次要终点；作为候选建议，待下游人审确认。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"6 分钟步行距离变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源资料将 6 分钟步行距离变化列为关键次要终点；作为候选建议，待下游人审确认。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"无进展生存期（疾病进展或死亡）。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源资料将无进展生存期列为关键次要终点；作为候选建议，待下游人审确认。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"圣乔治呼吸问卷（SGRQ）总分变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源资料将 SGRQ 总分变化列为关键次要终点；作为候选建议，待下游人审确认。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"安全性终点：AE/SAE、实验室检查、生命体征、ECG、耐受性、减量和停药。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"用户确认安全性随访和 IDMC 安全性审阅；具体安全性终点集合需在 SAP 中细化。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"measurement_details\": \"采用符合 ATS/ERS 标准的标准化肺量计，由中心化判读；第 52 周访视窗口为 ±7 天；缺失数据采用 MMRM 在随机缺失假设下分析，敏感性分析采用多重插补与模式混合模型。\",\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"estimand\": {\n    \"treatment\": {\n      \"text\": \"AD-101 100 mg qd、AD-101 200 mg qd 或匹配安慰剂 qd，口服，随机 1:1:1，双盲；所有组每次服用 4 片以维持盲态：100 mg 组 = 2 片 AD-101 50 mg + 2 片匹配安慰剂，200 mg 组 = 4 片 AD-101 50 mg，安慰剂组 = 4 片匹配安慰剂；AD-101 组出现耐受性问题时可减量至 50 mg qd，恢复后可回到原随机剂量。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户明确治疗组、剂量、盲态维持、减量规则和给药方式。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"population\": {\n      \"text\": \"经 HRCT 或肺活检确诊 IPF 的成人受试者；计划入组约 120 例，1:1:1 随机至三个治疗组。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户明确研究人群和计划入组量。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"variable\": {\n      \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL），采用符合 ATS/ERS 标准的标准化肺量计并由中心化判读。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户样本量假设和肺功能测定要求明确该变量及测量方式。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"ice_strategy\": {\n      \"text\": \"治疗中止采用治疗政策；死亡采用复合策略；肺移植采用假想策略；急性加重采用治疗政策；使用禁用或救援治疗采用治疗政策，并做假想策略的敏感性分析。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户明确列出各伴发事件的处理策略。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"ice_events\": [\n      \"治疗中止\",\n      \"死亡\",\n      \"肺移植\",\n      \"急性加重\",\n      \"使用禁用或救援治疗\"\n    ],\n    \"summary_measure\": {\n      \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值的组间差异（AD-101 各剂量 vs 安慰剂；固定序列检验先 200 mg 后 100 mg），采用 MMRM 在随机缺失假设下分析，敏感性分析采用多重插补与模式混合模型。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户确认主要分析模型、缺失数据处理及固定序列检验。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"sample_size\": {\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值组间差异为 170 mL。\",\n      \"共同标准差为 250 mL。\",\n      \"双侧 α=0.10。\",\n      \"把握度为 80%。\",\n      \"脱落率约 15%。\",\n      \"1:1:1 随机分组。\",\n      \"计划入组约 120 例（每组约 40 例）。\"\n    ],\n    \"alpha\": \"双侧 α=0.10（每个比较的名义水平；固定序列检验，不强制控制总体 I 类错误）。\",\n    \"power\": \"80%。\",\n    \"model\": \"主要分析采用 MMRM，在随机缺失假设下分析第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值；敏感性分析采用多重插补与模式混合模型。\",\n    \"planned_n\": \"约 120 例（每组约 40 例），1:1:1 随机。\",\n    \"attrition\": \"约 15%。\",\n    \"justification\": \"基于第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值组间差异 170 mL、共同标准差 250 mL、双侧 α=0.10、80% 把握度及约 15% 脱落率，1:1:1 随机，计算约 120 例（每组约 40 例）。该设计支持固定序列检验：先 AD-101 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，达到统计学显著后再检验 AD-101 100 mg qd 对比安慰剂；II 期探索性研究不强制控制总体 I 类错误，同时报告名义 p 值与 95% 置信区间。\",\n    \"questions\": [],\n    \"references\": [\n      {\n        \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n        \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/5:p\",\n        \"quote\": \"Planned enrollment: approximately 120 subjects, randomized 1:1:1\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"interim_planning\": {\n    \"timing\": \"定期审阅安全性数据；治疗期 52 周，末次给药后 4 周安全性随访至第 56 周。不设疗效期中分析。\",\n    \"information_fraction\": \"不适用（无疗效期中分析；安全审阅不依赖疗效信息分数）。\",\n    \"purpose\": \"独立数据监查委员会（IDMC）定期审阅安全性数据，仅提供安全性建议，不做疗效决策，不消耗 I 类错误。\",\n    \"decision_rule\": \"无预先设定的疗效决策规则；IDMC 仅基于安全性数据提供安全性建议。\",\n    \"decision_responsibility\": \"IDMC 负责安全性审阅和建议；无疗效决策责任。\",\n    \"final_analysis_impact\": \"无疗效期中分析，不进行 alpha 分配或消耗；不影响最终疗效分析的 I 类错误控制。\",\n    \"alpha_spending\": null,\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"non_inferiority_margin\": null,\n  \"questions\": [],\n  \"unresolved_questions\": []\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"design-elements.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"design-elements-intake","sha256":"5b2a20844e470f1c78b74cc54ed114828c5fe0a063dc7ed56c93343024ebab96"}],"logical_call_id":"call:design-elements:0e59cddb199c63dae1b699fc13d1fac538f78917e977bee2c9ac21ec5e55606f:design-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:design-elements:0e59cddb199c63dae1b699fc13d1fac538f78917e977bee2c9ac21ec5e55606f:design-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-latest-cloud","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/design-elements-output.v1.json","output_sha256":"8f77b154183aa481085de513619a433d789bea5d9479ec32f64f80a650129433","prompt_sha256":"21bf2955294ee9cc2fd35ad41a9fec8e8279bf3e566b47d7babf7c624d527a38","provider_session_id":"d83a5bee-d43e-45a4-952a-76a5666ec71b","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}